  "description": {
    "sub_id3": null,
    "sub_name": "ESG永續報告編製與查核實務",
    "sub_ename": "PREPARATION OF A SUSTAINABILITY REPORT AND ASSURANCE PRACTICES",
    "describe_ch": "本課程以 ESG 為出發，除介紹永續揭露的重要性外，將說明永續報告書中所使用的 GRI、SASB 及 TCFD 準則，此外亦介紹目前最新的 IFRS S1 與 S2 準則之公報內容，瞭解目前全球各種永續揭露規範。最後將說明第三方機構與會計師事務所如何進行永續報告書之查核業務，透過永續報告實作以瞭解如何進行永續報告書之編製及查核實務。",
    "describe_eh": "This course firstly introduces what is ESG and the importance of sustainable disclosure. Moreover, this course introduces the sustainable standards, such as GRI, SASB, and TCFD used in sustainability reports. The latest standards, IFRS S1 and S2 also will be introduced. Students will comprehend the disclosure sustainable standards at present through the above introduction. Finally, this course will explain how the sustainability reports are audited by the third-party organizations (i.e., BSI) and accounting firms. Students will comprehend the preparation of a sustainability report and assurance practices through a term report.",
    "pre_subname": "",
    "pre_sub_id3": null,
    "pre_sub_ename": "",
    "pre_describe": null,
    "pre_describe_en": null,
    "scr_credit": 3.0
  },
